        "message": "=<h2>🤝 Personalized Lead Follow-up</h2>\n\n<p>Hello {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json['Full Name'] }},</p>\n\n<p>Thank you for your interest in our AI automation solutions.</p>\n\n<p>We understand that you're looking to improve your business processes through automation. Our team can help you design an intelligent solution tailored to your requirements, helping streamline operations, improve efficiency, and automate repetitive tasks.</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h3>Your Requirement</h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Company:</strong> {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json['Company Name'] }}</li>\n<li><strong>Service:</strong> {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json['Interested Service'] }}</li>\n<li><strong>Budget:</strong> {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json['Budget'] }}</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p>We would be happy to arrange a brief 15-minute discovery call to understand your requirements in more detail and discuss the best approach for your business.</p>\n\n<p>Please let us know a convenient time to connect.</p>\n\n<p>Best regards,<br>\n<strong>The AI Solutions Team</strong></p>",
